# The API image is built with the REPO ROOT as context (render.yaml: dockerContext .).
# BuildKit honours "<dockerfile path>.dockerignore" in preference to the context root's
# .dockerignore, so this file keeps the context small without reaching outside apps/api.
.git
.worktrees
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/api/build
apps/api/.gradle
apps/api/.kotlin
apps/web
docs
